WEBVTT

00:02:28.704 --> 00:02:31.704
My first position, I was confused
for the secretary.

00:02:31.746 --> 00:02:33.246
I was pissed.

00:02:34.121 --> 00:02:35.746
But it lit a fire in me.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.913
So I want to get more people
in the industry.

00:02:37.913 --> 00:02:39.954
And in 2013, that's what I started doing.

00:02:39.954 --> 00:02:42.204
Working in small groups
with kids and students,

00:02:42.204 --> 00:02:43.704
teaching them STEM activities.

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:45.954
Then in 2014,

00:02:45.996 --> 00:02:48.704
I lost my little brother
to the prison system.

00:02:49.204 --> 00:02:52.996
In 2015, I lost all faith
in the system, period.

00:02:53.746 --> 00:02:56.704
The world watched the following
of Freddie Gray uprising

00:02:56.746 --> 00:02:58.204
as Baltimore burned.

00:02:58.246 --> 00:03:00.746
I wondered when were people
going to listen,